# <%= data.site.title %>

> <%= data.site.meta_description %>

This is the personal blog of <%= data.site.author.name %>. Articles are published at
permalinks of the form `/YYYY/MM/DD/{slug}/` and listed newest first below. Each post has a
Markdown version at `/YYYY/MM/DD/{slug}/index.md`, and a request to the permalink with
`Accept: text/markdown` also gets it. The links below go to the Markdown versions. The content
signals are in <%= full_url('/robots.txt') %>. The full archive lives at <%= full_url('/blog/') %>.

## Key pages

- [About](<%= full_url(AboutHelpers.about_page(data.pages) ? '/.well-known/about.md' : '/about/') %>): About <%= data.site.author.name %> and this site.
- [Atom feed](<%= full_url('/feed.xml') %>): Machine-readable feed of recent articles.

## Articles
<% llms_articles.each do |article| %>
- [<%= sanitize(article.title) %>](<%= full_url(entry_markdown_path(article)) %>)<% if article.summary.present? %>: <%= sanitize(article.summary)&.truncate(200, omission: "…", separator: " ")&.tr("\n", " ") %><% end %>
<% end %>

## Optional

- [Blog](<%= full_url('/blog/') %>): The complete archive of articles, newest first, as HTML, with the older articles that are not listed above.
